  "Scope": "One bounded native validity-only pilot, baselinedebbe46b plus archived patch. Existing controlled native entry no longer derives discarded UTF16 metadata; same strict2048-byte validation blocks/error offsets/work/token/deadline and separate required result projection. No new mode/owner/API or removed metering. Eleven equal-result public Count/IsMatch/valueMatch operations: Chinese corpus live/deadline calls, unchanged ordinary and numeric-finite Count controls, ASCII bool/value controls, folded mixed bool and UTF8-family projected match. Four before/after/diagnostic predecoded/decode-then Regex lanes. Complete UTF16 range digest for Match; boolean/count results checked after timing. Full strict validation included, setup/compilation excluded. Warm1.5s/min64calls, independent60ms calibration, five alternating samples each\u003E=20ms. One120s cap,at most one selected noise confirmation. Numeric finite Count already used validity-only and is not a newly optimized route. No package/full-catalog campaign.",
